{"id":5979130,"date":"2026-02-09T16:07:59","date_gmt":"2026-02-09T21:07:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/?p=5979130"},"modified":"2026-02-09T16:07:59","modified_gmt":"2026-02-09T21:07:59","slug":"tp-links-kasa-hs103-a-smart-plug-with-solid-network-connectivity","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/tp-links-kasa-hs103-a-smart-plug-with-solid-network-connectivity\/","title":{"rendered":"TP-Link\u2019s Kasa HS103: A smart plug with solid network connectivity"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><em>With Amazon\u2019s smart plug teardown \u201cin the books\u201d, our engineer turns his attention to some TP-Link counterparts, this first one the best behaved of the bunch per hands-on testing results.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/tapo-or-kasa-which-tp-link-ecosystem-best-suits-ya\/\">Two months back<\/a>, I introduced you to several members of TP-Link\u2019s Kasa and Tapo smart home product lines as successors to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.belkin.com\/support-article\/?articleNum=335419\">Belkin\u2019s then-soon and now<\/a> (at least as you read these words, a few weeks after I wrote them) defunct Wemo smart plug devices. I mentioned at the time that I\u2019d had particularly good luck, from both initial setup and ongoing connectivity standpoints, with the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tp-link.com\/us\/home-networking\/smart-plug\/hs103\/\">Kasa HS103<\/a>:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/TP-Link-Kasa-HS105.jpg?resize=538%2C847\" width=\"538\" height=\"847\" \/><\/p>\n<p>An example of which, I mentioned at the time, I\u2019d shortly be tearing down both for standalone inspection purposes and subsequent comparison to the smaller but seemingly also functionally flakier <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kasasmart.com\/us\/products\/smart-plugs\/kasa-smart-plug-mini-ep10\">Tapo EP10<\/a>:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/Kasa-smart-Wi-Fi-plug-mini.jpg?resize=950%2C950\" width=\"950\" height=\"950\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Today, I\u2019ll be actualizing my HS103 teardown aspiration, with the EP10 analysis to follow in short order, hopefully sometime <em>next<\/em> month. What\u2019s inside this inexpensive device, and is it any easier to disassemble than was <a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/Amazon-smart-plug-works-with-Alexa\/dp\/B089DR29T6\">Amazon\u2019s Smart Plug<\/a>, which I <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/amazons-smart-plug-getting-inside-requires-more-than-just-a-tug\/\">dissected last month<\/a>?<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/amazon-smart-plug.jpg?resize=938%2C1500\" width=\"938\" height=\"1500\" \/><\/p>\n<h2>Plain is appealing<\/h2>\n<p>Let\u2019s find out. As usual, I\u2019ll begin with some outer box shots of the four-pack containing today\u2019s patient. You may call the packaging \u201cboring\u201d. I call it refreshingly simple. As well as recyclable.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979095\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_top-44.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979092\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_front-50.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979093\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_left-side-31.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979090\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_back-45.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979094\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_right-side-29.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979091\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/box_bottom-45.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Sorry, I couldn\u2019t resist including that last one \ud83d\ude00.<\/p>\n<p>Now for the device inside the box, beginning with a conceptual block diagram. Interestingly, although <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/tapo-or-kasa-which-tp-link-ecosystem-best-suits-ya\/\">I\u2019d mentioned back in December<\/a> that TP-Link now specs the HS103 to handle a current draw of up to 15A, the four-pack (HS103P4) graphic on Amazon\u2019s website still list 12A max:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5979127 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51Xs1wkj3DL._SL1000_.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C950\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"950\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51Xs1wkj3DL._SL1000_.jpg?w=1000 1000w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51Xs1wkj3DL._SL1000_.jpg?w=150 150w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51Xs1wkj3DL._SL1000_.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51Xs1wkj3DL._SL1000_.jpg?w=768 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Its three-pack (HS103P3) graphic counterpart eliminates the current spec entirely, replacing it with the shadowy outline of an AC outlet set, which I suppose is one way to fix the issue!<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979128\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51ZSNvBl-L._SL1200_.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C950\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"950\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51ZSNvBl-L._SL1200_.jpg?w=1200 1200w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51ZSNvBl-L._SL1200_.jpg?w=150 150w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51ZSNvBl-L._SL1200_.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51ZSNvBl-L._SL1200_.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/51ZSNvBl-L._SL1200_.jpg?w=1024 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>And now for some real-life shots, as usual (and as with subsequent images) accompanied by a 0.75\u2033 (19.1 mm) diameter U.S. penny for size comparison purposes:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979105\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_front-54.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979106\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_left-side-36.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979103\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_back-56.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979107\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_right-side-35.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>See that seam? I \u2018spect that\u2019ll be a key piece for solving the puzzle of the pathway to the insides:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979108\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_top-62.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>And, last but not least, all those specs that the engineers out there reading this know and love, including the FCC certification ID (<a href=\"http:\/\/fcc.io\/2AXJ4KP115\">2AXJ4KP115<\/a>):<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979104\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/overview_bottom-65.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2>Cracking (open) the case<\/h2>\n<p>Now to get inside. Although I earlier highlighted the topside seam, I decided to focus my spudger attention on the right side to start, specifically the already visible gap between the main chassis and the rubberized gasket ring:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979119\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=771&#038;resize=771%2C1024\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=3072 3072w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=226 226w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=771 771w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=1157 1157w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=1542 1542w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening1.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 771px) 100vw, 771px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979120\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=771&#038;resize=771%2C1024\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=3072 3072w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=226 226w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=771 771w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=1157 1157w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=1542 1542w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening2.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 771px) 100vw, 771px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Quickly results-realizing that I was indirectly just pushing the side plate (containing the multi-function switch) out of its normal place, I redirected my attention to it more directly:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979121\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=771&#038;resize=771%2C1024\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=3072 3072w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=226 226w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=771 771w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=1157 1157w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=1542 1542w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening3.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 771px) 100vw, 771px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979122\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=771&#038;resize=771%2C1024\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=3072 3072w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=226 226w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=771 771w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=1157 1157w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=1542 1542w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side-opening4.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 771px) 100vw, 771px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Success, at least as a first step!<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979116\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened1.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979115\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-switch-outside.j