ket-inside.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-gasket-inside.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-gasket-inside.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-gasket-inside.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened_end-gasket-inside.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>At this point, however, we only have a visual tease at the insides:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979118\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C715\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"715\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=4080 4080w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=300 300w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=1536 1536w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/side_opened3.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Time for another Amazon-supplied conceptual diagram:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979129\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/61TQtHb9OVL._SL1000_.jpg?w=950&#038;resize=950%2C950\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"950\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/u