\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/main-body_opening1.jpg?w=1157 1157w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/main-body_opening1.jpg?w=1542 1542w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/main-body_opening1.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/main-body_opening1.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 771px) 100vw, 771px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>It wouldn\u2019t be a proper teardown without at least a bit of collateral damage, yes?<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979096\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=771&#038;resize=771%2C1024\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=3072 3072w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=226 226w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=768 768w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=771 771w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=1157 1157w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=1542 1542w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=1900 1900w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/collateral-damage-2.jpg?w=2850 2850w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 771px) 100vw, 771px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Onward, I endure it all for you, dear readers:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5979099\" src=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/main-body_opening2.jpg?w=771&#038;resize=771%2C1024\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/main-body_opening2.jpg?w=3072 3072w, https:\/\/www.edn.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/main-body_opening2.jpg?w=226 226w, ht